VALUES ('recXcvKvWb2CrQyb6', 'girona-riders-girona', 'Escola ciclisme Girona - Girona Riders', 'Pavelló Fontajau', '672 53 83 71', 'info@gironariders.com', 'https://www.gironariders.com/', 'Girona - Domeny i Fontajau', 'Des de Girona Riders oferim un extraescolar de ciclisme de muntanya, on es', 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/56/56/1785859200000/E55GNVurZ0YMdAJr8EBKvg/1mU5wFdrPFV_nRNqHU34o29LMf07BaD2BcFB89UB-NJxjuVbTeVKxgNlirGqO3Xgq-3ziLNy2F84WBVJGFYcui9qD5adOnExt3sSzy5fxMeuwBeGb9JqF3nxlcc-jjiNNbmes8so0aatbW27gdaZgILFXPnz5pbQXPsRLPQ65Yiiqpjw1-JXDkhvDAbhk1JzOCWLIxEIMhFuKMYNZJGFPA/-SXj5AryyxiPiNkazFCe23K56A7eR7dfz2d5PS19EFc', TRUE, '', 'girona')
