Explorarem diferents tècniques de dibuix i pintura potenciant la imaginació, la confiança i la creativitat, sempre des del joc i la diversió.', '1:15 h', '', '*15€ trimestrals de material', '', '', '', TRUE, 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/56/56/1785859200000/MXtdqTnT7Libpqp-B3JKUg/vVGEY2EUU5vck_a9Agh0vj3PwTBaVm_A4kjcZbJWOdAj8pp3ciUXcj-Jy7r8PiYR-qE2-ibRJPs9iYdFbW_vQ1hMvG6VaUr5RJfAxAPlsb8TISZuCWynN4hc4h2F4Cnqv6TBtneRJCWAQKEJzttgJQ/o8lTMzpYOK3uSceqYc7SekP1MRtCvQGnFiGQL4tLzFo', 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/56/56/1785859200000/xzPYrLIKGCopH0pMaIr8qg/d3TqA1wSWJg-Qpz2DjrrbkYhZAq1JpVeACKL8-5YjXUx4muz0QW46yBRZYFze3GiZ1WPvrjr8E3BNGpw53b34BFFOP-NxYEWCnyxmho0pTyFsZJ81my-x-AkVZ1i55Uw8qBFwMQfP2LaKlFkyKTycA/pum0kXOHF2M8unsN_7pA-z5NH3qpD6HU75rTSofNAU0', '{}', '', 'Taller', '', '', '', '', 'girona')
